  \resources\Uninstall_Confirmation_Desc\Text:
    Candidate Language=MT-MT: Jekk tispiċċa tħoss in-nuqqas tat-tiftix, sigurtà, u ftuħ imtejba, erġa’ ejja f’Windows 11 fi kwalunkwe ħin.
